    'tpl.fix':['implement-spec','先用 diagnosing-bugs 定位根因；规格和实施票齐备且状态允许后，按 implement-spec 修复。','Diagnose the root cause with diagnosing-bugs; fix with implement-spec only when the spec, tickets and status allow it.'],
